{"id":"37ec92ca6163508a","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-ultrafilter-sum.md","title":"Ultrafilter Sum (Comultiplication)","display":"df-ultrafilter-sum — Ultrafilter Sum (Comultiplication)","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-ultrafilter-sum","aliases":["17-df-ultrafilter-sum"],"display":"df-ultrafilter-sum — Ultrafilter Sum (Comultiplication)","depends_on":["[[17-df-ultrafilter]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-6.2.2b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-ultrafilter-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-ultrafilter-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ultrafilter-sum — Ultrafilter Sum (Comultiplication)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-6.2.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(I_j)_{j\\in J}\">\\((I_j)_{j\\in J}\\)</span> (family of pairwise disjoint index sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> (ultrafilter on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_j\">\\(I_j\\)</span> for each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in J\">\\(j\\in J\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9e920083cdf9b067\" href=\"?note=9e920083cdf9b067\" title=\"17-df-ultrafilter\">17-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{(j,i):j\\in J,\\ i\\in I_j\\}\">\\(I=\\{(j,i):j\\in J,\\ i\\in I_j\\}\\)</span> (disjoint union)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_V U_j\">\\(\\sum_V U_j\\)</span> (ultrafilter sum defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_V U_j\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\nX\\subseteq I:\n\\{j\\in J:\n\\{i\\in I_j:(j,i)\\in X\\}\\in U_j\n\\}\\in V\n\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_V U_j\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\nX\\subseteq I:\n\\{j\\in J:\n\\{i\\in I_j:(j,i)\\in X\\}\\in U_j\n\\}\\in V\n\\Bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The displayed set is an ultrafilter on the disjoint union <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.  The usual\nisomorphism between an ultraproduct by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_VU_j\">\\(\\sum_VU_j\\)</span> and the corresponding iterated\nultraproduct is a theorem; it is not itself the definition of comultiplication.\nRestricting one ultrafilter to arbitrary partition pieces would not in general\nproduce ultrafilters.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V$ (ultrafilter on $J$, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U_j$ (ultrafilter on $I_j$ for each $j\\in J$, see [[17-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"(I_j)_{j\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"I_j","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in J","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\{(j,i):j\\in J,\\ i\\in I_j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_V U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_V U_j\n=\n\\Bigl\\{\nX\\subseteq I:\n\\{j\\in J:\n\\{i\\in I_j:(j,i)\\in X\\}\\in U_j\n\\}\\in V\n\\Bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_VU_j","display":false}],"bytes":1428,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued